@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
title Archive a displayed active contact (successful path)
participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant "command:ArchiveCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant "model:Model" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant "target:Person" as Target MODEL_COLOR
participant ":Storage" as Storage STORAGE_COLOR

note over Logic, Command
  AddressBookParser has parsed archive 1
  using ArchiveCommandParser.
end note
Logic -> Command : execute(model)
activate Command
Command -> Model : getFilteredPersonList()
Model --> Command : displayed
note right of Command
  Reject an out-of-range index.
  Resolve target from displayed before replacement.
end note
Command -> Target : isArchived()
Target --> Command : false
Command -> Target : withArchive(true)
Target --> Command : archived (new Person, same contact details)
Command -> Model : setPerson(target, archived)
note right of Model
  Replaces target in AddressBook.
  The observable filtered view updates;
  its predicate is unchanged.
end note
Model --> Command
Command --> Logic : CommandResult("Archived 1 contact.")
deactivate Command
Logic -> Model : getAddressBook()
Model --> Logic : addressBook
Logic -> Storage : saveAddressBook(addressBook)
Storage --> Logic
note over Logic, Storage
  JsonAdaptedPerson stores the archive flag.
  A save failure is reported as CommandException.
end note
@enduml
